+# Explicit upper-orbital source mode
+
+This portable source admission composes exact qualified5a/f77 as a separately
+checked parent with the distinct e49b10-position/38-normal/44-face BODY recipe.
+Six formerly frozen boundary rows are openly included; no old-boundary assertion
+is run against this child and no old129 proof is transferred. The original code,
+masters, strict failure, recipes and old source modes remain available.
+
+`generate_upper_orbital_transition_v1.py` reproduces e49b by editing existing
+BODY tables after the immutable original BIN prefix; all Y/Z, UV, skin, rig,
+clip, eye/hair/image/index and standing-foot data remain exact. The old
+canonical_socket_interface_v1 geometry kernel/policy is imported unchanged:
+178 inherited/expanded scan faces, only original20 same-side interface faces,
+full-segment containment,14/7mm engineering bounds, zero new exterior/undeclared/
+wrong-side/patch-patch crossings.20mm,4MiB and20ktriangle limits stay fixed.
+
+The selected compact qualification summary binds newly executed e49b actual
+65-key+64-midpoint physical and all129 posed socket proofs, original9176-byte
+loop,Float64/state capture and closed supervisor receipts. Source checks validate
+those exact-byte records; they do not pretend to rerun a browser. Root accepted
+only the visible local ledge reduction in matched16 source frames. Remaining
+appearance/anatomy, real current yard views and app/full gates are not accepted.
+
+`python3 tools/test_standing_horse_upper_orbital.py` runs meaningful in-memory
+source/certificate corruptions and fresh native static admission via unchanged
+policy helpers. `--source-only` is explicitly partial and does not run the static
+proof. Old5a tests still check the preserved parent, with its old controls and
+recipe. No source-mode selection installs Blender or adds a collision exemption.
